### Upload the sample statements (run from the project folder)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/imports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="ES9121000418450200051332_2026-09.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/ES9121000418450200051332_2026-09.csv
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="GB33BUKB20201555555555_2026-09.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/GB33BUKB20201555555555_2026-09.csv
--boundary--

> {% client.global.set("importId", response.body.importId); %}

### Import status: per-file counts and skipped lines
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/imports/{{importId}}

### Monthly report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/ES9121000418450200051332/reports/2026-09

### Groceries in September
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/ES9121000418450200051332/transactions?month=2026-09&category=GROCERIES

### Reconciliation result
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/expected-payments?accountId=ES9121000418450200051332
